exports[`World W1 fixture panel > shows all six places for each of the ten fixture states (DOM snapshot per state) > 1-fresh_account 1`] = `"<p role="note" style="margin: 0px 0px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(138, 59, 0);">TEST DATA — synthetic World fixture, not a user profile</p><div role="group" aria-label="Fixture state" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><button aria-pressed="true" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">1. Fresh account</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">2. Configured agents, no attributed work</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">3. One active request and tracked goal</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">4. A decision requiring review</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">5. Completed goal with evidence and cost</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">6. A failed and a cancelled request</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">7. A memory with provenance and one without</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">8. A forecast refusal and a usable forecast</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">9. A measured growth result and an inconclusive one</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">10. Disconnection, stale records, replay and reconnect</span></button></div><p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px;">No model, memories or runs. Workers present but switched off; nothing attributed. No project chosen.</p><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px;"><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(216, 211, 200); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-width: 0;" aria-label="Arrival table — prepare a brief" data-place="commons"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 4px; font-size: 15px;">Arrival table</h3><div>Host: henry (orchestrator) · 3 request(s) this visit</div><div>Object: The work folio on the arrival table</div><div>Primary: <strong>Prepare a brief</strong> [prepare, does not send]</div><div>Also: Sit together · Send to orchestrator (explicit) · Review a decision · Resume conversation</div><ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 6px 0px;"><li data-slot-state="ready" data-stale="false"><strong>Orchestrator status</strong> <span>[C3]</span>: 1 shown<ul><li>Orchestrator: idle · 0 in flight</li></ul></li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Goals in flight</strong> <span>[C5]</span>: empty — No goal is ready or executing. Goals awaiting review are in the Decision Inbox.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Waiting for your review</strong> <span>[C5]</span>: empty — Nothing is waiting for your review.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Recent requests</strong> <span>[C3]</span>: empty — The orchestrator reports no recent tasks.</li></ul><div style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">Accessible: Places list → Arrival table → Prepare a brief</div></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(216, 211, 200); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-width: 0;" aria-label="Garden archive — browse memories" data-place="gallery"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 4px; font-size: 15px;">Garden archive</h3><div>Host: librarian (librarian) · 2 request(s) this visit</div><div>Object: The open source folio beside the Librarian</div><div>Primary: <strong>Browse memories</strong> [local, does not send]</div><div>Also: Open in Brain · Ask about this evidence · Save field note (explicit) · Try an example (demonstration)</div><ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 6px 0px;"><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Remembered records</strong> <span>[C4]</span>: empty — Nothing has been remembered yet. Memories appear after conversations, notes or documents are saved.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Librarian activity</strong> <span>[C2]</span>: empty — Nothing attributed to librarian in this window. That does not prove it was inactive.</li><li data-slot-state="setup_required" data-stale="false"><strong>Project notes</strong> <span>[—]</span>: setup required — Choose a project to see its notes.</li></ul><div style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">Accessible: Places list → Garden archive → Browse memories</div></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(216, 211, 200); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-width: 0;" aria-label="Maker workshop — inspect current work" data-place="maker"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 4px; font-size: 15px;">Maker workshop</h3><div>Host: steward (git_steward) · 2 request(s) this visit</div><div>Object: The task folio on the workbench</div><div>Primary: <strong>Inspect current work</strong> [navigate, does not send]</div><div>Also: Compare request and result · Review required decision · Prepare a repair brief · Inspect a skill · Open Build</div><ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 6px 0px;"><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Steward goals</strong> <span>[C2]</span>: empty — No goals are owned by git_steward.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Steward activity</strong> <span>[C2]</span>: empty — Nothing attributed to git_steward in this window. That does not prove it was inactive.</li><li data-slot-state="ready" data-stale="false"><strong>Attributed spend</strong> <span>[C2]</span>: 1 shown<ul><li>$0.00 · 0 calls — Spend attributed through the 0 goal(s) owned by git_steward. Session cost is a separate scope; do not add them.</li></ul></li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Needs review</strong> <span>[C5]</span>: empty — Nothing is waiting for your review.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Saved skills</strong> <span>[C6]</span>: empty — No skills are saved yet. A proposal is not a saved skill.</li></ul><div style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">Accessible: Places list → Maker workshop → Inspect current work</div></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(216, 211, 200); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-width: 0;" aria-label="Observatory — inspect a forecast" data-place="council_garden"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 4px; font-size: 15px;">Observatory</h3><div>Host: forecaster (forecaster) · 2 request(s) this visit</div><div>Object: The instrument desk beneath the dome</div><div>Primary: <strong>Inspect observation versus forecast</strong> [local, does not send]</div><div>Also: Choose a project and signal · Compare a Council report · Prepare “What would change this forecast?” · Save a hypothesis (explicit)</div><ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 6px 0px;"><li data-slot-state="setup_required" data-stale="false"><strong>Observations and forecasts</strong> <span>[—]</span>: setup required — Choose a project to see its forecasts.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Council reports</strong> <span>[C7]</span>: empty — No Council session has finished yet.</li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Forecaster activity</strong> <span>[C2]</span>: empty — Nothing attributed to forecaster in this window. That does not prove it was inactive.</li></ul><div style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">Accessible: Places list → Observatory → Inspect observation versus forecast</div></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(216, 211, 200); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-width: 0;" aria-label="Observatory garden — review a hypothesis" data-place="observatory_garden"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 4px; font-size: 15px;">Observatory garden</h3><div>Host: forecaster (forecaster) · 0 request(s) this visit</div><div>Object: The telescope and the field notebook on its plinth</div><div>Primary: <strong>Review my hypothesis</strong> [prepare, does not send]</div><div>Also: Look through the telescope · Inspect this sky · Sit and ask · Return to Observatory · Return to Arrival · Save to project (explicit)</div><ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 6px 0px;"><li data-slot-state="setup_required" data-stale="false"><strong>Saved hypotheses</strong> <span>[—]</span>: setup required — Choose a project to see its saved hypotheses.</li><li data-slot-state="ready" data-stale="false"><strong>About this sky</strong> <span>[C7]</span>: 1 shown<ul><li>Survey backdrop derived from Gaia EDR3 (CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO). Orientation is artistic and the planets are illustrative: this is not live or calibrated sky data.</li></ul></li></ul><div style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">Accessible: Places list → Observatory garden → Review my hypothesis</div></section><section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(216, 211, 200); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; min-width: 0;" aria-label="Conservatory — inspect an intervention" data-place="conservatory"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 4px; font-size: 15px;">Conservatory</h3><div>Host: growth_measurement (growth_measurement) · 3 request(s) this visit</div><div>Object: The measurement folio on the potting bench</div><div>Primary: <strong>Inspect an intervention</strong> [local, does not send]</div><div>Also: Compare before and after · Explain this verdict · Open Grow · Try the water demonstration (demonstration) · Save an observation (explicit)</div><ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 6px 0px;"><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Measured interventions</strong> <span>[C8]</span>: empty — No intervention has been measured yet. Implemented is not the same as helped.</li><li data-slot-state="ready" data-stale="false"><strong>Grower availability</strong> <span>[C1]</span>: 1 shown<ul><li>Grower: configured off · reachable not_probed · ready not_ready · used none_attributed_in_window · <u>Manage agent</u></li></ul></li><li data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><strong>Grower activity</strong> <span>[C2]</span>: empty — Nothing attributed to growth_measurement in this window. That does not prove it was inactive.</li></ul><div style="color: rgb(85, 85, 85);">Accessible: Places list → Conservatory → Inspect an intervention</div></section></div>"`;

