ring review</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">5. Completed goal with evidence and cost</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">6. A failed and a cancelled request</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">7. A memory with provenance and one without</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pad: 6px 10px;"><span class="pa-btn__label">8. A forecast refusal and a usable forecast</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" style="--pa-btn-radius: 6px; --pa-btn-success: #34D399; --pa-btn-bg: transparent; --pa-btn-fg: #FFFFFF; --pa-btn-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --pa-btn-bg-hover: #262D3F; --pa-btn-border-hover: rgba(0,213,255,0.18); --pa-btn-bg-active: #1E2433; --pa-btn-pa